---
// In English only.
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";
import Topbar from "../components/Topbar.astro";
---
<Page path="/license" title="License · Outbound" description="The source of Outbound is public to read and improve. Using it needs a license.">
<Topbar />

<main class="page">
  <div class="wrap-narrow prose">
    <h1>License.</h1>
    <p class="lede">The code is public so you can read it, learn from it and help improve it. Using Outbound needs a license.</p>

    <h2>You may</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Read, fork and change the source code.</li>
      <li>Build and run it to study it, try it out, or prepare a contribution.</li>
      <li>Use Outbound on up to three of your Macs once you have bought a license.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>You may not</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Use Outbound as your wallpaper without a license, whether you downloaded it or built it yourself.</li>
      <li>Share, sell or publish Outbound or work based on it, apart from forks made to contribute back.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>The full text</h2>
    <p>The license in full is in the <a href="https://github.com/kewonit/outbound/blob/main/LICENSE">LICENSE</a> file in the repository. Outbound comes with no warranty.</p>
    <div class="cta-row page-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-light" href="/#buy" data-url="buy" data-soon="Coming soon">Buy for $4.99</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
</Page>
